  "description": "Install new sum pump in the basement. At ground floor, replace the double doors on the east elevation with a window, reposition the partition in the storage room to create a smaller store together with repositioning of the door, erection of internal walls in part of the existing garage to create 1 bedroom and 1 bathroom, insertion of a new door into the garage to provide access to the new bedroom and bathroom, Insertion of double doors to provide direct access to the garden, removal of part of existing walls and installation of new sliding and folding doors to create a combined kitchen/dining room, erection of internal partitioning to create a utility room, installation of a new kitchen.  At first floor, erect a 1st floor side extension to create ensuites for 2 bedrooms together with the insertion of 2 new doors in the bedrooms to access the ensuites, new ceiling plasterboard in the 4 first floor bedrooms, insertion of a new internal staircase to provide access from the 1st floor to the proposed terrace, removal of the existing first floor bathroom and toilet, blocking up the doorway to the bedroom and repositioning the door, insertion of a cupboard in the bedroom, creation of a new toilet and bathroom, repositioning a door and a window on the northern elevation. At terrace level, demolition of a wall in the existing tank room to create a bedroom, and bathroom, construction of a swimming pool and erection of a new parapet wall.",
